0_3647704813663907542_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3iLAszLgWA0Q7kNvwEgKA9n&_nc_oc=AdoRv6go7Wo9c_U_EaBmA8Xt3UBqEU7LlXKoGOSXe-lsBhdKaF0pdbybHEHfbOL9D-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVD2y-O_YWaaQ7bbzKoYlmVlRqX1Yph8O7fbixPE_CBXQ&oe=6B106B91"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pickle Tag", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pickle Tag\nThe Ultimate Brine-Fueled Chase!\n\nMaster the iconic \"arm-swinging\" locomotion you love with a crisp, green twist. Pickle Tag takes high-energy VR movement and drops it into a world of competitive chaos. No buttons, no joysticks\u2014just pure physics as you fling yourself across vibrant maps to avoid being tagged.\n\nWhy Play Pickle Tag?\nMaster the Movement: Dive into polished, physics-based mechanics that make every leap and climb feel responsive and rewarding.\n\nVinegar-Fueled Parkour: Navigate vertical playgrounds, hidden corners, and high-speed lanes designed for elite escapes.\n\nSocial & Competitive: Join a growing community of players. Whether you\u2019re playing casual tag or competitive rounds, there\u2019s always a lobby waiting.\n\nGet Your Crunch On: Stand out with unique pickle-themed aesthetics and immersive environments.\n\nStop loafing around\u2014grab your controllers and join the jar!", "short_description": "Experience the crunch! Inspired by the movement mechanics of Gorilla Tag, Pickle Tag brings a vinegary twist to the VR chase genre. Use your hands to climb, jump, and swing through immersive maps as you outrun\u2014or hunt down\u2014your friends."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/petagpolicyfr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RVXGT/AIDENVR/PICKLES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/petagofficial/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOM